ion-trigger\u003e \u003ch3\u003eFeatures\u003c/h3\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-content\"\u003e \u003cul\u003e \u003cli\u003eDesigned specifically for 2-wheel drive buggies to ensure optimal fit and performance\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003eLightweight construction at 30 grams for improved speed and handling\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003eWhite finish provides a stylish and clean appearance\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003eHex hub design for easy installation and secure attachment\u003c/li\u003e \u003c/ul\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"product-accordion-item\" data-accordion\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-header\" data-accordion-trigger\u003e \u003ch3\u003eHow to use\u003c/h3\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-content\"\u003e \u003cp\u003eTo use the Tamiya Hop-Up Options No.2044 Front Star Dish Wheel, remove the existing front wheel on your compatible 2Wd buggy and install this upgrade wheel by securing it onto the hex hub. Ensure the wheel is tightly fastened to maintain proper performance and safety. Regularly check for any wear or loose fittings during use to keep your buggy running smoothly.\u003c/p\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"product-accordion-item\" data-accordion\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-header\" data-accordion-trigger\u003e \u003ch3\u003eCare instructions\u003c/h3\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-content\"\u003e \u003cp\u003eClean the wheel regularly with a soft cloth to remove dirt and debris, which can affect performance. Avoid using harsh chemicals or abrasive materials that may damage the plastic finish. Store your buggy and wheels in a dry, dust-free environment to prolong their lifespan and maintain optimal condition.\u003c/p\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e","category":"general","has_sufficient_data":true,"status":"success","error_message":null,"processed_at":"2026-03-08T15:30:56+09:00","processing_duration_ms":5621.450925}
